name: sim.getDialogInput
description: msgBox or simUI.inputDialog instead.
luaSynopsis: string input=sim.getDialogInput(int genericDialogHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. genericDialogHandle: handle of the generic dialog
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. Pointer to a text buffer or nullptr in case of an error. The user is in charge of releasing the returned string with simReleaseBuffer.
replacedBy:
- use simUI functions
